<mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;LaminarFlow-Backend/internal/frontend/frontend.go&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" y="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#class#handler&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;handler&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" y="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;package frontend&lt;/font&gt; — exported (+) method on the unexported *handler&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;this is the http.Handler implementation; &lt;a href=&quot;#func#NewMux&quot;&gt;api.NewMux&lt;/a&gt; mounts it at &quot;/&quot;, so it&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;answers every path the API does not claim&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="60" width="700" y="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;func (h *handler)&lt;b&gt; ServeHTTP(&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;w http.ResponseWriter&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;r *http.Request&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="700" y="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Returns nothing — the whole response goes out through w: a file from the bundle, the app&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;shell, 404, 405, or the &quot;frontend not built&quot; page with 503. There is no error value;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;every failure is written as a status code instead&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="60" width="700" y="460" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;-&amp;gt; void (early return after 405, after an invalid path, after a served file, or after the shell)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" y="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;GET and HEAD are all a bundle of static files answers. Without this the catch-all replied&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;to POST /healthz with the shell and 200, so any write to any unrouted path looked like it&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;succeeded — found by LAM-39&#39;s routing tests&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if r.Method != http.MethodGet &amp;amp;&amp;amp; r.Method != http.MethodHead {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;w.Header().Set(&quot;Allow&quot;, &quot;GET, HEAD&quot;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;http.Error(w, &quot;method not allowed&quot;, http.StatusMethodNotAllowed)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;name := strings.TrimPrefix(path.Clean(r.URL.Path), &quot;/&quot;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if name == &quot;&quot; {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;name = indexFile&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;fs.ValidPath rejects &quot;..&quot;, absolute paths, and anything else that could escape the bundle.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;http.FileServer does that for you; doing the lookup by hand means doing this by hand too&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if !fs.ValidPath(name) {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;http.NotFound(w, r)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if h.&lt;a href=&quot;#func#handler.serveFile&quot;&gt;serveFile&lt;/a&gt;(w, r, name, name != indexFile) {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;a missing file that looks like an asset is a 404, not a fallback: serving HTML in answer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;to a .js request makes the browser report &quot;Unexpected token &#39;&amp;lt;&#39;&quot;, which points&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;nowhere near the stale hash that actually caused it. Client routes are extensionless by&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;convention, so the extension is the signal — /docs/readme.md would 404 under this rule,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;the right trade against silently breaking every asset 404&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if path.Ext(name) != &quot;&quot; &amp;amp;&amp;amp; name != indexFile {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;http.NotFound(w, r)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;unmatched route: hand back the app shell so the client router can resolve it.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Deliberately 200, not 404 — the route may well be real to the SPA&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if h.&lt;a href=&quot;#func#handler.serveFile&quot;&gt;serveFile&lt;/a&gt;(w, r, indexFile, false) {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;notBuilt is a one-const HTML page: the Go server is running and the API is available, but&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;no bundle is embedded — a blank 404 here is the confusing case, so it says so instead&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;w.Header().Set(&quot;Content-Type&quot;, &quot;text/html; charset=utf-8&quot;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;w.WriteHeader(http.StatusServiceUnavailable)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;_, _ = w.Write([]byte(notBuilt))&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;same-origin by decision (Architecture notes §2): a split origin breaks the cookie session&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;auth browsers increasingly refuse to send cross-site, so this catch-all and the API share&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;one process and one port&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="1040" width="700" y="550" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
